the Composite Volleyball features a high-quality composite cover and reinforced butyl bladder for reliable air retention, soft touch, and control. Ideal for training, school, and competitive use.<\/p>","slide_3_button_label":"Shop Volleyball Now","slide_3_button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/composite-volleyball","slide_4_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/VBKWM-Comfort-Knee-Pads-white-800x1000px_21baf7b9-81cb-4157-a341-09ad57643d4a.png","slide_4_subheading":"Knee Pads","slide_4_heading":"Comfort Knee Pads","slide_4_description":"<p>Slim, flexible knee pads with five contoured EVA sections for reliable impact protection and comfort. Lightweight and secure, they move naturally with you during training and game play.<\/p>","slide_4_button_label":"Shop Knee Pads Now","slide_4_button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/comfort-knee-pads","slide_5_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CB163_Coaching-CoachingBoards-Volleyball-800x1000px_41769be9-653c-4557-8ebd-053bebb62e2f.png","slide_5_subheading":"Coaches Board","slide_5_heading":"Coaches Board Volleyball","slide_5_description":"<p>Plan, strategize, and communicate plays with this versatile plexiglass coaching board. Measures 16\" x 10\" x 3 mm and includes a black dry-erase marker. One side shows a full playing field, the flip side displays a half-field layout.<\/p>","slide_5_button_label":"Shop Coaches Board Now","slide_5_button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/coaches-board?variant=40556602753153","slide_6_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/VNA1-Volleyball-72inAntenna-800x1000px.png","slide_6_subheading":"Volleyball","slide_6_heading":"Antenna","slide_6_description":"<p>Keep every play visible with these 72” fiberglass volleyball antennas. Durable, stable, and easy to attach, they feature red stripes for high visibility and secure placement on standard nets. Ideal for schools, clubs, and competitive matches.<\/p>","slide_6_button_label":"Shop Antenna Now","slide_6_button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/antenna","slide_7_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SB4188_Coaching-FlipScoreboard-800x1000px_422c57cf-42af-4ffc-97a2-ad7184f9ec6b.png","slide_7_subheading":"Volleyball","slide_7_heading":"Scoreboard","slide_7_description":"<p>Keep every game on track with our portable flip scoreboards. With clear numbers, durable construction, and easy-to-read team colors, they’re perfect for basketball, volleyball, and more.<\/p>","slide_7_button_label":"Shop Scoreboard Now","slide_7_button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/scoreboard-flip","slide_8_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Y200-InflationAndPumps-DoubleActionHandPump-800x1000px_5fdd1675-fcdc-4e77-9bfa-da0b967e7e22.png","slide_8_subheading":"Inflation & Pumps","slide_8_heading":"Double Action Hand Pump","slide_8_description":"<p>Compact and durable pump inflates on both strokes; includes brass needle, and optional hose for versatile use.<\/p>","slide_8_button_label":"Shop Hand Pump Now","slide_8_button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/double-action-hand-pump"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_1e9960d_bwdnmn"],"name":"Swipeable carousel","settings":{}},"text_and_image_pNUcRg":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Storage_2cc8167a-655b-4817-bdbd-509fc6e17945.png","image_width":650,"subtitle":"Store, Transport, Play","title":"Game-Ready Gear","text":"<p>Keep your volleyballs organized and ready for action. From practice to game day, these essentials help you store, carry, and move balls with ease—so you can focus on playing your best.<\/p><p><strong>Product Highlights:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Folding Ball Cart:<\/strong> Holds up to 22 balls and folds for easy storage. <\/li><li><strong>Ball Bag:<\/strong> Durable, easy-to-carry bag for multiple balls. <\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"Shop Folding Ball Cart","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/folding-ball-cart","button_label2":"Shop Ball Bag","button_link2":"shopify:\/\/products\/ball-bag","button_sty